      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://swissglorious.com/towns-and-cities/witikon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A short tram ride brings you from Witikon straight to Zürich’s city center, making it a quiet base for city exploration.",
